So, in summary, we can quickly recap that we have talked about the design prototype evaluate cycle, then how to build and evaluate prototypes; 

280.1
00:36:09.602 --> 00:36:14.867
we also talked about the full-fledged empirical evaluation with

281
00:36:15.539 --> 00:36:18.943
a larger number of users and a fully developed system.

